### Default URL
GET http://localhost:8080/

### Fetch all users
GET http://localhost:8080/contact/

@uid=6ae5c136aa37644ecf48b4b8
### Get contact
GET http://localhost:8080/contact/{{uid}}

### Create a contact
POST http://localhost:8080/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "age": 25
}